> BETWEEN TETRIS AND CHESS. HUMAN BRAIN WILL NEVER GET ACCUSTOMED TO
> NON-NATURAL-TYPE LANGUAGES TO THE GRADE WHEN IT WON'T THINK WHILE SPEAKING
